        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-11>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-v2-delphi10000-bos-taurus-turing-wavelength-s0-5>,
